UID:6a0f45978e677a28001d8b1d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:What would it be like to be transported into the pages of yo
 ur latest fantasy read? That's what happens to Lan in author Linh S. Ngu
 yen's middle-grade fantasy novel\nNo Place Like Home\n. Join us for a v
 isit from Linh\, where she will read from her book\, talk about her jou
 rney to becoming an author\, and share how her identity as a Vietnamese
  immigrant to Canada shapes her characters and her work.\nDrop in. No re
 gistration required\n. This program is intended for children ages 9-11 a
 nd their caregivers. For groups larger than 5\, please contact the bran
 ch.
LOCATION:Parkdale\, Auditorium
