 ightweight\, high‑strength 3‑D bridges out of K’NEX. Test the streng
 th of your bridge using a specialized “Bridge‑Crusher” rig. Then lea
 rn how multiple designs and modifications can influence real‑world struc
 tural strength.\nSuitable for children ages 6 to 12.
LOCATION:S. Walter Stewart\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a050690caf93436005bc944
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
