BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Diving Deep- Wax Resist Underwater World
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260818T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260818T150000
UID:6a11b42be8af4a2f00748b8d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this creative workshop\, participants will learn to draw an
 d paint their very own underwater scene using pastels and water colours! T
 hey’ll explore the magical world beneath the sea as they add vibrant col
 ours to their artwork\, and discover how to create stunning textures by sp
 rinkling salt onto their water colours. This fun\, hands-on class will ins
 pire imagination while teaching techniques that bring the underwater world
  to life with depth and texture.\nAges 6-12\nRegistration is required.
LOCATION:Amesbury Park\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a11b42be8af4a2f00748b8d
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
