BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Parent/Child Graphic Novel Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260603T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260603T193000
UID:694ac7789fb47cac989f34b9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Share the love of reading as members of our book club for kids
  and parents! Read a book together\, then join us once a month at the libr
 ary to chat about the book. Was it a great read? Or a total stinker? All o
 pinions and thoughts are welcome and appreciated. For kids ages 9 to 12 an
 d their grown-ups.\nNo registration required. Copies will be available at 
 the front desk on a first-come\, first-served basis one month before each 
 meeting.
LOCATION:Runnymede\, 2nd Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/694ac7789fb47cac989f34b9
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
