DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260617T170000
UID:6a107527e13d3b4603b51719@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Read widely and watch your imagination flourish! This event is
  curated to help kids find their next best read. Fort York Branch staff 
 will share their book recommendations\, all of which can be borrowed from
  the Toronto Public Library. Attendees are also welcome to share their fav
 ourite reads. Staff will also share about upcoming special summer events 
 at the Fort York Branch!\nNo registration required.
