DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260620T150000
UID:6a00ccb9055b429f3b3ad0af@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join author and veterinarian Nadja Lubiw-Hazard for an interac
 tive storytelling program as she reads from her children's chapter book\, 
 Tizzy and Me: Fifteen Ways to Love a Mink. The story is narrated by spunky
  seven-year-old Georgia\, who lives with her two moms and their dog Tizzy.
   tells a story celebrating animal activism and 2SLGBTQ+ families.  Follow
 ing the reading\, there will be a Q&A with the author and a storytelling a
 ctivity using story stones.
