BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:After School Club - Therapy Dog
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260611T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260611T170000
UID:6a0765aacaf93436005c2490@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a visit with a therapy dog at the After School Clu
 b on June 11th.\nChildren will have an opportunity to read\, listen to st
 ories\, and engage in therapeutic human-animal interaction.\nThis program 
 is presented in partnership with One Health Partners.\nDrop-in\, no regist
 ration required.  Please note that families will be asked to sign up for 
 time slot with the therapy dog upon arrival.\nSnacks are offered during th
 e After School Club for participants. Ingredient lists will be available. 
 Snacks are generously supported\, in part\, by donors.
LOCATION:Bloor/Gladstone\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a0765aacaf93436005c2490
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
