UID:6a0f0ef8703c33630028fc64@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:One in ten children are born before 37 weeks and with that com
 es different early life experiences. You may be asked to avoid crowds and 
 stay home. There could be other medical conditions with early learning and
  milestones  getting put off to go to appointments\, and schooling comes 
 with it's own challenges.\nThis session is to provide school age children 
 and families with extra learning experiences in a low pressure and calm e
 nvironment.\nWe will:\nEnjoy a sea slug petting zoo (no real sea slugs wil
 l be used)\nHave a chance to use a microscope and explore pond life.\nDesi
 gn a table top aquarium for display.\nInclude the parents\, with a break s
 tation.\nHave a reading of "The Little Mermaid by Hans Christian Andersen.
 " 2:00pm\nThis is a drop in program with an accessibility focus. You may s
 tay a few minutes or the whole session as you like.
LOCATION:Maryvale\, Meeting Room
