BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Harry Turns 70! Celebrating Canadian Illustrators
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260615T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260830T235959
UID:6a062ed1c6a1dc3d00d3c6ee@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Harry the Dirty Dog turns 70!\nCelebrate 70 years of a beloved
  classic and the illustrations behind it. This exhibit highlights the work
  of Margret Bloy Graham and her ability to bring stories to life through h
 er artwork. Visit the Osborne collection to experience our exhibit\, which
  also spotlights the contributions of Canadian illustrators\, featuring wo
 rks from artists all across the country.\nThe exhibit can be viewed during
  the Osborne Collection's open hours. Located on the 4th floor of the Lil
 lian H. Smith Branch.
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, Osborne Collection of Early Children's Books. 
 4th floor. The exhibit is open during the same hours as the branch.
