DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260602T170000
UID:69fe5658c7d3cd580057f8e6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:For ages 8-12.\nLight up your imagination! In this hands-on wo
 rkshop\, young engineers will explore the basics of electricity and electr
 onics using Snap Circuits. We'll learn how to build simple circuits to pow
 er lights\, make sounds\, and more. Participants will work in pairs to con
 struct projects from the Snap Circuits blueprints. No prior experience is 
 needed—just bring your curiosity!\nDrop in. No registration required\, b
 ut space is limited.
LOCATION:Fairview\, Room 201
