DESCRIPTION:Animal lover Mabel seizes an opportunity to use a new technolo
 gy to 'hop' her consciousness into a life-like robotic beaver and communic
 ate directly with animals. As she uncovers mysteries in the animal word be
 yond anything she could have imagined\, Mabel befriends charismatic beaver
  King George and must rally the entire animal kingdom to face a major\, im
 minent human-threat: smooth talking local mayor Jerry Generazzo.\nRated PG
 .
LOCATION:Danforth/Coxwell\, Program Room\, 2nd Floor.
