 ially welcome. Suitable for school-aged children ages 6 and up. Siblings a
 ges 6 and up are welcome.\nPlease Note:\nA maximum of 5 children can parti
 cipate in the program during each 15-minute time slot. Timeslots are avail
 able on a first come first serve basis.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nT
