BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wonder Workshop: Pollinators Challenge
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260713T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260713T153000
UID:6a10679fc7d3cd58005ae1ed@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever wondered at the beauty of a monarch butterfly an
 d what they overcome to survive? What would happen if these important poll
 inators disappeared? Join us to learn all about the journey of the monarch
  butterfly. Then use your imagination to design and build your own mock bu
 tterfly garden station. Plus\, enter a prize draw for a chance to win an a
 wesome book. For kids ages 6 to 12.\nRegistration is required. For ages 6-
