 eatures that live there. Use your imagination and brainstorm creative solu
 tions to develop a machine that cleans the ocean of trash and pollution. P
 lus\, enter a random draw for a chance to win a book prize.\nRegistration 
 is required. For ages 6-12 only (children outside of this age range will n
 ot be able to participate).\n*For all registered Children's programs at Hu
 mberwood\, there is a grace period of 10 minutes. After the first 10 minut
 es of a program\, spots will be given to waiting customers.*
