BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kids & Parents Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260613T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260613T160000
UID:6a19aeeb90cc4e3a7909e431@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Our book for June is The Arrival by Shaun Tan. The Arrival is
  a migrant story told as a series of wordless images. A man seeks better p
 rospects in a faraway country and finds himself in a city of foreign custo
 ms\, peculiar animals\, and indecipherable languages. A brilliant book abo
 ut immigration\, as well as a startlingly original work of art.\nCopies av
 ailable at the library\nThe Arrival
LOCATION:Mimico Centennial\, Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a19aeeb90cc4e3a7909e431
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
